; Plugin a declares the cross-ref kind plus a form `phrase`. Plugin b
; (extra-b.sjon) ALSO declares a form named `phrase`, so the bare
; `:target phrase` lookup finds two claimants. Schema-aggregate phase
; emits `ambiguous_cross_ref_target`.
(plugin :name ambig-xref-tgt-a :version "1.0.0"
  (value-kind :name phrase-name
    :underlying symbol
    :cross-ref (cross-ref :target phrase))

  (form :name phrase
    (key :name name :type symbol :optional false)))
